{
  "schema_version": "workflow_package.v1",
  "id": "com.himind.media.workflow.generate-video",
  "version": "0.1.5",
  "distribution_targets": [
    "workbench",
    "github"
  ],
  "name": "对话生成短视频",
  "description": "从一句需求生成 Plan、校验 Recipe、创建项目、生成预览，并在审批后提交渲染。",
  "release_notes": "0.1.5：明确 allow_network 仅允许模型调用、工具策略仍为 none；补充单/多镜头与 Workflow 独立安装说明。",
  "min_agent_version": "0.3.47",
  "local_requirements": {
    "platform": "windows",
    "workspace": "directory",
    "required_tools": [],
    "recommended_tools": []
  },
  "execution_policy": "segmented",
  "entrypoints": [
    {
      "id": "plan",
      "at_step": "GV-CATALOG",
      "label": "从需求开始生成",
      "requires": []
    }
  ],
  "default_entrypoint": "plan",
  "default_exitpoint": "render_started",
  "exits": [
    {
      "id": "planned",
      "at_step": "GV-ESTIMATE",
      "label": "计划已校验",
      "produces": []
    },
    {
      "id": "generated",
      "at_step": "GV-GENERATE",
      "label": "项目与预览已生成",
      "produces": []
    },
    {
      "id": "render_started",
      "at_step": "GV-RENDER",
      "label": "渲染已提交",
      "produces": []
    }
  ],
  "capabilities": [
    "media.workbench.catalog.list",
    "media.workbench.data.ingest",
    "media.workbench.data.bind",
    "media.workbench.plan.normalize",
    "media.workbench.plan.estimate",
    "media.workbench.generate.run",
    "media.workbench.quality.check",
    "media.workbench.render.start"
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "skills": [],
    "plugins": [
      "com.himind.media-workbench"
    ],
    "connectors": [],
    "runtimes": [
      "himind.builtin"
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "GV-CATALOG",
      "title": "读取能力目录",
      "kind": "capability",
      "capability_id": "media.workbench.catalog.list",
      "execution_mode": "sync",
      "risk_level": "read_only",
      "input": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "GV-DATA",
      "title": "读取数据文件",
      "kind": "capability",
      "capability_id": "media.workbench.data.ingest",
      "execution_mode": "sync",
      "risk_level": "read_only",
      "depends_on": [
        "GV-CATALOG"
      ],
      "when": {
        "operator": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "operator": "exists",
            "path": "input.path"
          },
          {
            "operator": "not_equals",
            "path": "input.path",
            "value": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      "input": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "GV-PLAN",
      "title": "生成导演计划",
      "kind": "runtime",
      "execution_mode": "sync",
      "risk_level": "read_only",
      "depends_on": [
        "GV-CATALOG",
        "GV-DATA"
      ],
      "runtime": {
        "provider": "himind.builtin",
        "prompt": "你是短视频导演。根据 Workflow context 中的 request、name、style_id、GV-CATALOG 输出（以及可选的 GV-DATA 数据摘要），生成一份可执行的短视频 Plan。\n\n规则：\n1. 只使用 catalog 中 status=ready 的模板；不要编造模板 id。\n2. 先判断叙事结构：排行/变化用 leaderboard-tech 或 bar-race；单点数字用 big-number；对比用 compare；占比用 composition；流程用 flow；时间线用 timeline；地图/线路用 choropleth 或 route-growth；多镜头用 storyboard。\n3. 按 request 的叙事问题选择结构，不要因为示例里出现某个模板就优先它：\n   - 排名/榜单 -> leaderboard-tech（单年 TOP N）或 bar-race（多年变化）\n   - 单点数字 -> big-number\n   - 对比 -> compare\n   - 占比/构成 -> composition\n   - 流程/步骤 -> flow\n   - 时间顺序 -> timeline\n   - 地理分布/路径 -> choropleth 或 route-growth\n   - 多镜头 -> storyboard\n4. 如果 request 明确指定 ready 模板，或已有项目需要沿用结构，优先使用该模板；否则按上面的叙事结构选择。\n5. 某些模板可以自带随包示例数据；没有 data 时可以使用模板默认数据，但必须在 Plan 的风险说明中标注“示例数据”。用户要求真实数据时，必须使用提供的 data/path，不能编造数字或来源。\n6. 如果 request 涉及真实数据但 context 没有提供 data，不要编造；在 narrative.risk_notes 中写明需要数据。\n7. 生成 Plan JSON，必须包含 version、brief、narrative、storyboard、presentation；storyboard.shots 至少一个，包含 shot、role、duration_seconds、data_binding、rationale。\n8. presentation.style_id 使用 style_id 或 tech-blue。\n9. 只输出 JSON 本身，不要 Markdown 代码块，不要解释。\n\n输出结构参考：{\"version\":\"himind.video.plan.v1\",\"brief\":{\"goal\":\"...\"},\"narrative\":{\"thesis\":\"...\",\"structure\":\"...\",\"required_data\":[],\"risk_notes\":[]},\"storyboard\":{\"shots\":[{\"shot\":\"composition\",\"role\":\"breakdown\",\"duration_seconds\":10,\"data_binding\":\"data\",\"rationale\":\"...\"}]},\"presentation\":{\"title\":\"...\",\"subtitle\":\"...\",\"source\":\"...\",\"style_id\":\"tech-blue\"}}",
        "workspace_path": "input.workspace_root",
        "result_schema": "schemas/video-plan.schema.json",
        "allow_network": true,
        "tool_policy": "none",
        "timeout_seconds": 180
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "GV-NORMALIZE",
      "title": "校验并规范化计划",
      "kind": "capability",
      "capability_id": "media.workbench.plan.normalize",
      "execution_mode": "sync",
      "risk_level": "read_only",
      "depends_on": [
        "GV-PLAN"
      ],
      "input": {
        "plan_step": "GV-PLAN"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "GV-ESTIMATE",
      "title": "估算时长与风险",
      "kind": "capability",
      "capability_id": "media.workbench.plan.estimate",
      "execution_mode": "sync",
      "risk_level": "read_only",
      "depends_on": [
        "GV-NORMALIZE"
      ],
      "input": {
        "plan_step": "GV-PLAN"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "GV-BIND",
      "title": "映射数据契约",
      "kind": "capability",
      "capability_id": "media.workbench.data.bind",
      "execution_mode": "sync",
      "risk_level": "read_only",
      "depends_on": [
        "GV-NORMALIZE",
        "GV-DATA"
      ],
      "when": {
        "operator": "all",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "operator": "exists",
            "path": "input.path"
          },
          {
            "operator": "not_equals",
            "path": "input.path",
            "value": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      "input": {
        "plan_step": "GV-NORMALIZE",
        "data_step": "GV-DATA"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "GV-GENERATE",
      "title": "创建项目并预览",
      "kind": "capability",
      "capability_id": "media.workbench.generate.run",
      "execution_mode": "long_running",
      "risk_level": "local_write",
      "depends_on": [
        "GV-ESTIMATE",
        "GV-BIND"
      ],
      "approval_required": true,
      "input": {
        "plan_step": "GV-NORMALIZE",
        "data_step": "GV-BIND",
        "preview": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "GV-QUALITY",
      "title": "运行质量门禁",
      "kind": "capability",
      "capability_id": "media.workbench.quality.check",
      "execution_mode": "sync",
      "risk_level": "read_only",
      "depends_on": [
        "GV-GENERATE"
      ],
      "input": {
        "project_step": "GV-GENERATE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "GV-RENDER",
      "title": "审批并提交渲染",
      "kind": "capability",
      "capability_id": "media.workbench.render.start",
      "execution_mode": "long_running",
      "risk_level": "local_write",
      "depends_on": [
        "GV-QUALITY"
      ],
      "approval_required": true,
      "input": {
        "project_step": "GV-GENERATE"
      }
    }
  ],
  "artifacts": [],
  "ui": {
    "mode": "declarative",
    "surfaces": [
      "agent",
      "dashboard"
    ],
    "entry": "ui/workflow-view.json"
  },
  "supported_runtimes": [
    "himind.builtin"
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-10-17T00:00:00Z"
}
